message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "Montenegro–Italy Electricity Trade Around the EU CBAM"
version: 0.1.0rc1
authors:
  - family-names: Zhu
    given-names: Hona
    affiliation: Stockholm School of Economics
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A coursework demonstration for Natural Resource and Energy Economics at
  Stockholm School of Economics, combining electricity market data engineering,
  spatial weather aggregation, RDiT, HAC inference and fixed-weight synthetic
  comparisons. Author: Hona Zhu. Contributors, in contribution order:
  Mohammad Amir, Jasper Wu, and John Sirin. Public examples use artificial data;
  empirical inputs and results are not distributed. The MIT licence covers
  original project software and original teaching materials, not third-party data.
keywords:
  - energy economics
  - electricity trade
  - geospatial data
  - reproducible research
  - CBAM
